# The build script is written on Windows but runs on the demo host, which is
# Linux. Checked out with CRLF it dies on the first line with "bad interpreter"
# - so this file is pinned to LF no matter which machine touches it.
*.sh text eol=lf

# The Windows launchers are the mirror image: they must keep CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.png binary
